Cusp Rulebook — Licensing
==========================

This repository is dual-licensed:

- The DATA in `programs/` is released under CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain).
  Loyalty-program thresholds and earning rates are facts; CC0 lets anyone reuse them.
- The SCHEMA (`schema/`), SCRIPTS (`scripts/`), and documentation are released under
  the MIT License.

